{"abstract":"The Commission hereby gives notice that it has instituted reviews pursuant to the Tariff Act of 1930 (\"the Act\"), as amended, to determine whether revocation of the antidumping duty orders on helical spring lock washers from China and Taiwan would be likely to lead to continuation or recurrence of material injury. Pursuant to the Act, interested parties are requested to respond to this notice by submitting the information specified below to the Commission.","action":"Notice.","agencies":[{"id":262,"json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/agencies/262","name":"International Trade Commission","parent_id":null,"raw_name":"INTERNATIONAL TRADE COMMISSION","slug":"international-trade-commission","url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/agencies/international-trade-commission"}],"body_html_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/html/2022/04/01/2022-06563.html","cfr_references":[],"citation":"87 FR 19134","comment_url":null,"comments_close_on":"2022-06-14","correction_of":null,"corrections":[],"dates":"Instituted April 1, 2022. To be assured of consideration, the deadline for responses is May 2, 2022. Comments on the adequacy of responses may be filed with the Commission by June 14, 2022.","disposition_notes":null,"docket_ids":["Investigation Nos. 731-TA-624-625 (Fifth Review)"],"dockets":[],"document_number":"2022-06563","effective_on":null,"end_page":19137,"executive_order_notes":null,"executive_order_number":null,"full_text_xml_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/xml/2022/04/01/2022-06563.xml","html_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2022/04/01/2022-06563/helical-spring-lock-washers-from-china-and-taiwan-institution-of-five-year-reviews","images":{},"images_metadata":{},"json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/documents/2022-06563?publication_date=2022-04-01","mods_url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/metadata/granule/FR-2022-04-01/2022-06563/mods.xml","not_received_for_publication":null,"pag